n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于这三个当地品种：（节选自朗巴赫公众号）\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Kurume: 树形较矮小，果实较小，产量较低，但风味强度很高，以柑橘、花香、茶感著称；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Dega：生长在较高海拔，耐寒能力强，酸质活跃；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Wolisho：树形较高，果实较大，产量较高，具有复杂的水果风味；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TLQvzsbN9k3qsnfbqq9YkkibLQ4NED3vmNibKZS2ol4HcCq7mxEUR0egkhhq7uZIn6vficObjd3iaribA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于Guji产区\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Guji位于埃塞的Oromia洲，其首府是Awasa，在很早期的埃塞行政划分里是属于Sidamo省，与埃塞咖啡另外驰名的Yigracheffe耶加雪菲同属于南部部族州SNNPR，后来埃塞行政划分重新规划后，原来的Sidamo省被拆分，少部分继续留在了SNNPR，大部分被拆分出去到Oromia州，其中就包括了Guji区域。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QicUbosw3GuOmSibYcZk0UNQaCPMunWJAgfTNm5ckqtLmg2P2BqZURicIic3oFHQm8HroynBgkYnHdZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Guji区域一直也出产非常高品种的豆子，在2015年，埃塞的商品交易中心ECX，将精品咖啡等级下的品项中，Guji被单独划分出来，作为产品品牌标识一样，与耶加雪菲并列在ECX的出口分级列表里。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Tt78AlV1Oout4VK9TgBp3uiaazLIx0cFznDdhY35qmv6hIdtZE7jfP8AeakhktGno9D4w0LHdyy5w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多咖啡豆，请关注淘宝店铺哈\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px